  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>You sprout 1d6 additional eyes, ears, mouths or noses. Consult the table below to find out which kind and the @Table[hitloc]{Hit Locations} Table to find out where. The new sensory organs are fully functional, but apart from an eye in the back (which could grant the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.0LdHytqyNmg2pcAX]{Combat Aware} Talent if the GM is feeling generous) they aren't very likely to provide any special modifiers or abilities. If you're unlucky the new organ grows over an existing one, like a mouth over an eye.</p><p></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>1d10</p></td><td><p>Sensory Organs</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>01-03</p></td><td><p>Eyes</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>04-05</p></td><td><p>Ears</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>06-08</p></td><td><p>Mouths</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>09-10</p></td><td><p>Noses</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
